WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:03.680
SCP-035 Vs SCP-173.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:06.839
The evil Possessive Mask vs The murderous
Sculpture.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:11.440
These objects are a lot less inanimate than
they should be, but are they evenly matched?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.789
The biggest advantage that SCP-035 has over
173 is the fact it doesn’t have a neck that

00:00:16.789 --> 00:00:21.860
the Sculpture could squeeze or snap, meaning
that 173 definitely couldn’t kill the Possessive

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:22.860
Mask.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:28.289
However, given that SCP-173 doesn’t have
a traditional mind, body, or face, we can’t

00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:33.000
really know for sure whether SCP-035 would
even see The Sculpture as a desirable host.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.730
A fight between these two may just result
in the somewhat hilarious sight of them both

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.550
just sitting around, not moving, in a room
together.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:41.170
We’ll call it a draw.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:41.589
Really!?

